{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38f4ed6e6293bdb6336686dc6e030a5d0a5e93550198d4f614c2ebbd20391ebf", "ja": "（西エリアでのツアーが無事終わった。\nさて、エミリーはどこにいるかな……お、ここか）", "zh": "（西部地区的巡演顺利结束了。话说回来，艾米莉在哪里呢……哦，在这里啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "fe2e632b5a5e17560bac7cdda892b12d5de6d4b1fbb544449ba2e37428738d05", "ja": "ふむふむ……ここは、できたてがおいしいと……。\nこのお店も、備忘録に追加しないと……。", "zh": "嗯嗯……这里是刚做好的最好吃……\n这家店也得记进备忘录才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7051b9b79a551502609d8757373208c3d936397a70145ef4a0c88e2863035a18", "ja": "お疲れさま、エミリー。\nあれ？　机の上にあるのはファンレターか？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉。\n咦？桌上放着的是粉丝来信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "32d5623f771e38da43facca1940e9c7a65225a3caef29c671acd738527b0fb9e", "ja": "あっ、仕掛け人さま！　はい、美咲さんが\nごヒイキ様方のお手紙を持ってきてくれたんです。", "zh": "啊，制作人先生！是的，美咲小姐把各位支持者的来信带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "f9038f0978b25ccc358b3ccb97c4c2138a25bf9b3b685518da9b34a64bb001e1", "ja": "西地区の公演行脚の感想がたくさん書かれていて……。\n喜んでいただけたようで、安心しました。", "zh": "里面写了好多对西区巡演的感想……。\n大家似乎都很开心，我也放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b7a7f6bcb62da8b4671618a297e33462176539070b3cf76ea6a16a86c7704aac", "ja": "そうか。よかったな、エミリー。\nん？　その、手元にあるメモ帳は？", "zh": "这样啊。太好了，艾米莉。\n\n嗯？你手边的那个笔记本是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "2bbfa2a573f6d7b34180ccd78d2caff563ef0e736064872838d6fbf6b9ec1f9c", "ja": "これは備忘録です。\nまたいつか、西地区へ行く時のための。", "zh": "这是备忘录。\n是为了将来某天再去西部地区时准备的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7f5bf5675809a31a2ccb509583a73c78d0c233afa503990cff91805ae9fc6249", "ja": "備忘録？", "zh": "备忘录？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "21982658e02e95a36588f1b0585ccbd637df65a76901becc71e7663d5d386dd2", "ja": "はい。お手紙の中でおいしいお店や、\n素敵な観光名所を紹介してくださって……。", "zh": "是的。您在信中介绍了许多美味的店，还有很棒的观光景点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "aa6a6491e6410b8c4123db53758bdb0806ca4fb426471a8d366b248df95582ee", "ja": "魅力的な場所ばかりなので、\n忘れないよう帳面に記していたのです。", "zh": "因为全都是些很有魅力的地方，所以我把它们记在本子上，以免忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1010_p", "source_sha256": "204d388e1f269ecd9dede1d1fbb2a7e770ded3f59fb41e93b01c26ea04f85093", "ja": "そうだったのか。ツアーでもいろいろ回ったけど、\n行けなかった場所も多かったからな……。", "zh": "原来如此。巡演时也去了不少地方，不过没能去的地方也很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e8080f168ae0638e32e7bd0bf446130543134d01a61d2b3e76979097b2c2f82f", "ja": "でも、ちょうどよかった。早速備忘録の出番だぞ。\n西エリアから、エミリーにオファーがあったんだ。", "zh": "不过，正好派上用场了。备忘录马上就要发挥作用了。西部地区那边向艾米莉发来了邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "c1be46b14e062ba73dc6e7bbeae58c38426edd4d7f999ed81b0b879f0f872368", "ja": "Wow！　本当ですか！？", "zh": "哇！真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b4ad82d76e243df9c2f59a267edd9563db7e98ab0072fdce1ca3e11549a239b6", "ja": "ああ。ラジオのゲストに呼ばれて……仕事の資料は\n作っておくから、エミリーは備忘録をまとめるといい。", "zh": "嗯。要去当广播节目的嘉宾……工作的资料我会准备好，艾米莉整理一下备忘录吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "1f5b1fc006834749810733085599d2efb442d429099d45d28cd8679cc88970fd", "ja": "はい！　こんなに早く機会が巡ってくるなんて……！\nやはり、京都の和菓子は外せませんよね……。", "zh": "是！没想到机会这么快就来了……！\n果然，京都的和果子是不能错过的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "0d01613507309f75f8919c9a5299a6e64a999e8d0c7eb48f2f8586963d7521f3", "ja": "ああ、でも三重でいただいたうどんは本当に\nおいしくて……できるならもう一度……！", "zh": "啊，不过在三重吃到的乌冬面真的很好吃……要是可以的话，真想再吃一次……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ae92218e5f2d85ca62c4e042b930908dc24695d97e38b60ac11e28007ce40103", "ja": "日帰りになると思うから、そんなにたくさん\n巡れないんだけど……聞いてるかな、エミリー？", "zh": "我想应该是当天往返，所以没法去太多地方……你有在听吗，艾米莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0343_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "b3cf3d4b439dd1506e6ccac8b2a2438939a00360ef58bbef53eecff9ffd04ff2", "ja": "本当に、どうしましょう……♪\n……また仕掛け人さまと、西地区に……えへへ♪", "zh": "真的该怎么办才好呢……♪\n\n……又要和制作人一起去西区……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
